# The build context for ci/images/web.Dockerfile, and only for it: BuildKit reads
# the ignore file named after the Dockerfile in preference to the root one.
#
# The web image copies nothing out of the checkout: every version it installs
# arrives as a build argument or is pinned in the Dockerfile itself. So the
# context is empty, and a change anywhere in the repository invalidates no layer
# of it.
*
